"Version 4" = "第 4 版";
"View" = "查看";
"Without a passcode, iPhone does not encrypt your notebook file and anyone holding the phone can open PassBy. Set a passcode in iPhone Settings." = "没有锁屏密码时，iPhone 不会加密密码本文件，拿到手机的人都能打开 PassBy。请在 iPhone 的「设置」里设置锁屏密码。";
"You have no backup yet. Export one and keep it somewhere else." = "你还没有备份。请导出一份，存到别处。";
"You need this code to open the file. Write it down or save it away from the file. PassBy does not keep it; without it the file cannot be opened." = "打开这个文件要用这串导出码。请抄下来，或和文件分开保存。PassBy 不保存导出码，丢了就打不开这个文件。";
"Your draft is kept on this iPhone. Tap New password to resume it." = "草稿留在这台 iPhone 上，点「新建密码」可以继续。";
"Your earlier notebook could not be moved completely, so nothing was changed. It is still on this iPhone. Please try again." = "旧密码本没能完整搬入，所以什么都没有改动。它还在这台 iPhone 上，请再试一次。";
"Your notebook becomes the same as the file. Everything in it now moves to Recently Deleted for 30 days." = "密码本会变成和文件一样。现有的内容移到「最近删除」，保留 30 天。";
"Your notebook changed since the last export, more than 30 days ago." = "上次导出已超过 30 天，这期间密码本有改动。";
"Your notebook from the earlier version has not been moved yet." = "旧版本的密码本还没有搬入。";
"Your notebook has moved." = "密码本已搬入。";
"PassBy asks when you open it, and again after 5 minutes away. Without Face ID it asks for your iPhone passcode." = "打开 PassBy 时验证一次，离开满 5 分钟后再验证。没有 Face ID 时用 iPhone 的锁屏密码。";
"PassBy has no account, so a backup is yours to keep. Export an encrypted file and store it somewhere else. Your notebook is also part of this iPhone’s own backups: turn on Advanced Data Protection for iCloud Backup, or use an encrypted computer backup, so nobody else can read it there." = "PassBy 没有账号，备份要你自己留。请导出一个加密文件，存到别处。密码本也在这台 iPhone 自己的备份里：请为 iCloud 云备份开启「高级数据保护」，或使用加密的电脑备份，这样别人读不到备份里的密码本。";
"PassBy no longer uses an account or iCloud sync. Your notebook from the earlier version is still on this iPhone. PassBy reads it with Face ID and keeps it on this iPhone from now on." = "PassBy 不再使用账号和 iCloud 同步。旧版本的密码本还在这台 iPhone 上，PassBy 用 Face ID 读出它，以后就存在这台 iPhone 上。";
"In short: no account. The app works offline, and your notebook never passes through our servers. Your phone keeps your notebook, and it moves with your phone's own backups and device transfers." = "一句话：没有账号，App 不联网，不经过我们的服务器；密码本由手机保管，跟着手机自己的备份和换机走。";
"Your entries (title, account, password and notes), folders, Recently Deleted and the date of your last export are kept in one PassBy file on this iPhone, protected by iOS file encryption: the file cannot be read while your iPhone is locked. PassBy adds no key of its own, so your notebook is only as secure as your device passcode and Face ID or Touch ID. Entries in Recently Deleted stay on this iPhone for 30 days, and you can delete them sooner. Deleting PassBy deletes the notebook on this iPhone." = "条目（标题、账号、密码、备注）、分组、「最近删除」和上次导出日期，存在这台 iPhone 上 PassBy 的一个文件里，由 iOS 的文件加密保护：手机锁着时读不出这个文件。PassBy 不另加自己的密钥，所以密码本的安全取决于你的锁屏密码和 Face ID 或触控 ID。「最近删除」里的条目在本机保留 30 天，你也可以提前删除。删除 PassBy 会删掉本机的密码本。";
"Backups and new iPhones" = "系统备份和换手机";
"Your notebook is included in system backups and device transfers, including iCloud Backup, computer backups and Quick Start. Apple or your computer keeps these backups; they do not pass through us. iCloud Backup: unless you turn on Advanced Data Protection, Apple can read the contents of your backup. We recommend turning on Advanced Data Protection, or using encrypted computer backups instead. Unencrypted computer backups: your notebook is likely stored unencrypted in the backup on your computer. We recommend selecting “Encrypt local backup” in Finder on a Mac, or in the Apple Devices app (or iTunes) on Windows." = "密码本跟着系统备份和换机走，包括 iCloud 云备份、电脑备份和「快速开始」。这些备份由 Apple 或你的电脑保存，不经过我们。iCloud 云备份：没有开启「高级数据保护」时，Apple 能读取备份内容，建议开启高级数据保护，或改用加密的电脑备份。不加密的电脑备份：密码本很可能以明文留在电脑的备份里，建议在 Mac 的「访达」，或 Windows 上的 Apple 设备 App（或 iTunes）里，勾选「加密本地备份」。";
"Encrypted export" = "加密导出";
"An export file is created only when you choose Export. It contains all entries and folders, but not Recently Deleted. It is encrypted with AES-256-GCM, using a key derived from your export code or passphrase with PBKDF2-HMAC-SHA256. The app generates the export code. We never store the export code or your passphrase; without them the file cannot be opened. You choose where the file goes. We never receive export files. If you save one to iCloud Drive, a computer or another app, that service keeps it under its own terms." = "只有你选择「导出」时才生成导出文件，内容是全部条目和分组，不含「最近删除」。文件用 AES-256-GCM 加密，密钥由导出码或你设的口令经 PBKDF2-HMAC-SHA256 派生。导出码由 App 生成。我们不保存导出码和口令，丢了就打不开这个文件。文件存到哪里由你选。我们收不到导出文件；存到 iCloud 云盘、电脑或其他 App 的，由那里的服务按其规则保存。";
"Face ID and clipboard" = "Face ID 和剪贴板";
"Face ID and Touch ID are handled by iOS. PassBy receives only the result, never your face or fingerprint data. Copied values stay on this iPhone and expire after 60 seconds; the app you paste into can read them." = "Face ID 和触控 ID 由 iOS 处理，PassBy 只收到验证结果，收不到面部或指纹数据。复制的内容只留在这台 iPhone 上，60 秒后过期；你粘贴进去的 App 能读到它。";
"The iPhone app works offline" = "iPhone 应用不联网";
"PassBy itself makes no network requests and includes no third-party advertising, analytics or crash-reporting SDK. Links in the app, such as this policy or Support, open in your browser only when you tap them." = "PassBy 本身不发出任何网络请求，不使用广告、统计或崩溃收集的第三方 SDK。App 里的隐私政策、支持等链接，只在你点了以后才在浏览器里打开。";
"Information we may receive" = "我们可能收到的信息";
"Crash reports and usage statistics: if you turn on Share With App Developers in Settings › Privacy & Security › Analytics & Improvements, Apple provides us with PassBy crash reports and aggregated usage statistics. They do not include your notebook, and Apple states that they do not identify you personally. Support email: when you email support@tenonai.cn, we receive your email address, your message and anything you attach, and use them only to reply to you. Never send passwords, export codes or your device passcode. Website: when you visit passby.tenonai.cn, our servers record the time, IP address and page requested, and delete these logs automatically after 6 months. Downloads: Apple handles downloads on the App Store; we see only aggregated figures." = "崩溃报告和使用统计：如果你在 iPhone 的「设置 › 隐私与安全性 › 分析与改进」里打开了「与 App 开发者共享」，Apple 会向我们提供 PassBy 的崩溃报告和汇总的使用统计，不含密码本内容；按 Apple 的说明，这些信息不能识别你本人。支持邮件：你发邮件到 support@tenonai.cn 时，我们会收到你的邮箱地址、邮件内容和你附上的信息，只用来答复你；请不要在邮件里发送密码、导出码或设备密码。网站：访问 passby.tenonai.cn 时，服务器会记录访问时间、IP 地址和访问的页面，6 个月后自动删除。下载：PassBy 通过 App Store 提供，下载由 Apple 处理，我们只能看到汇总数据。";
"Data left by earlier versions" = "旧版本留下的数据";
"From version 2.0, PassBy no longer uses Tenon Account sign-in or iCloud sync. Sign-in records that earlier versions left on our servers were deleted when that service shut down. The encrypted notebook that earlier versions synced to iCloud stays in your own iCloud, and we cannot delete it; you can delete PassBy's data when you manage your iCloud storage in iPhone Settings. The earlier notebook file on this iPhone is kept after it is moved into this version." = "从 2.0 起，PassBy 不再使用 Tenon 账号登录和 iCloud 同步。旧版本登录时留在我们服务器上的记录，已在旧服务停用时删除。旧版本同步到你 iCloud 里的加密密码本，留在你自己的 iCloud 里，我们无法删除；你可以在 iPhone 的「设置」里管理 iCloud 储存空间时，删除 PassBy 的数据。这台 iPhone 上的旧密码本文件，搬入这个版本后仍然保留。";
"Your rights" = "你的权利";
"You can access, copy, correct or delete your personal information, withdraw consent, or ask us to explain how we handle it. You manage your notebook yourself in the app. For anything else, email support@tenonai.cn and we will reply within 15 working days." = "你可以查阅、复制、更正、删除你的个人信息，撤回同意，或要求我们解释处理规则。密码本在 App 里由你自己管理；其他请求请发邮件至 support@tenonai.cn，我们会在 15 个工作日内答复。";
